{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"some"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of its IDs."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deletedIDs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"remote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absence means nothing."}]}]},{"name":"deletedIDs","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}]}]},{"name":"preserving","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in the full reconcile. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" has no authority over them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":". This store’s own un-drained "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"folded in automatically."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counterpart to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes is where deletions come from."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A partial snapshot "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}]},{"type":"text","text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entirely by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":", which the caller must have positive evidence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An ordered, keyed collection of identifiable entities that silently records","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every mutation for downstream persistence.","type":"text"}],"title":"EntityStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingmissing:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"removingMissing"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against an authoritative snapshot from storage."}]},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/changes":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/changes","title":"changes","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accumulated changes since the last "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resetChanges()"},{"type":"text","text":" call."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"changes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeSet","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux9ChangeSetV"}]},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"some"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of its IDs."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","type":